1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,958
You arrive in a new area. The streets are unfamiliar, and you do not know your way around.

2
00:00:06,258 --> 00:00:13,917
Where is a nearby mosque? Choose your location or area in DiscoverSalah to find listed mosques nearby.

3
00:00:14,217 --> 00:00:18,958
Alongside the mosque location, check congregation times for prayers from Fajr to Isha.

4
00:00:19,258 --> 00:00:26,042
Prayer time beginning and congregation starting are different. The focus here is Jama’at time.

5
00:00:26,342 --> 00:00:32,208
Found the mosque and checked the time? Open Google Maps for directions to its entrance.

6
00:00:32,508 --> 00:00:39,708
Check the timing before leaving and allow extra travel time. Arrival on time is not guaranteed.

7
00:00:40,008 --> 00:00:46,833
Travelling, new to the neighbourhood, or out for work? Browse mosque locations and timings without an account.

8
00:00:47,133 --> 00:00:53,000
Who updates the timings? The local mosque representative submits new timings or changes.

9
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:58,583
A focal person checks the update by speaking with the registered Imam.

10
00:00:58,883 --> 00:01:03,667
The administrator assigns responsibilities across areas so the team can work together.

11
00:01:03,967 --> 00:01:11,250
Nobody approves their own update. Another responsible person checks it, then approves or returns it for correction.

12
00:01:11,550 --> 00:01:16,292
If a new timetable starts on a future date, it takes effect on that date.

13
00:01:16,592 --> 00:01:22,625
See an incorrect time? Report it. A small contribution can help improve the information.

14
00:01:22,925 --> 00:01:28,958
Your mosque is missing? Suggest it so it can be added after the required checks.

15
00:01:29,258 --> 00:01:33,917
Want to help? Apply to contribute and follow your request’s status.

16
00:01:34,217 --> 00:01:38,042
Private Imam phone numbers are not shown to the public.

17
00:01:38,342 --> 00:01:46,000
DiscoverSalah: find mosque locations and Jama’at times in an unfamiliar area, and help your community.
